{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14265","headline":"晚过敷水驿却寄华州使院张郑二侍御 · 窦牟","name":"晚过敷水驿却寄华州使院张郑二侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春雨如烟又若丝，晓来昏处晚晴时。\n仙人掌上芙蓉沼，柱史关西松柏祠。\n几许岁华销道路，无穷王事系戎师。\n回瞻二妙非吾侣，日对三峰自有期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14265.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14265","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}